---
import SiteShell from "../components/SiteShell.astro";
import PostIt from "../components/PostIt.astro";
---

<SiteShell title="Home" description="!localhost is a three-week design sprint at Srishti Manipal Institute. We are taking speculative work off our laptops and putting it on the public web.">
    <section class="grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.6fr)_minmax(220px,1fr)] md:items-center md:py-24">
        <div>
            <p class="mb-5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">A three-week design sprint · SMI 2026</p>
            <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl leading-[1.05] sm:text-7xl">Take it off localhost.</h1>
            <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed">We’re building speculative worlds in the studio. As they take shape, we’re finding ways for other people to enter them, try something, and see the choices behind the work.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/today" class="inline-block bg-[#ccff00] px-5 py-3 font-semibold shadow-[3px_3px_0_#202020] hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[1px_1px_0_#202020]">See today’s work →</a>
                <a href="/brief" class="inline-block border border-gray-700 bg-white px-5 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100">Read the brief</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center py-6 md:justify-end">
            <PostIt rotate={4}>
                <h2>Two things to make</h2>
                <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal pl-5">
                    <li>Your project, on a public URL.</li>
                    <li>A showcase, made together.</li>
                </ol>
            </PostIt>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-6 border-t border-gray-300 py-10 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl">If you’re in the class</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md leading-relaxed">Start with <a class="text-link" href="/today">today’s brief</a>. It’s the place for the current task. Keep <a class="text-link" href="/resources">resources</a> nearby when you hit a problem.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl">If you’ve just arrived</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md leading-relaxed">The student showcase is being built during the sprint. In the meantime, the <a class="text-link" href="/brief">course brief</a> explains what we’re making and why.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteShell>
